            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoca el método <code>setInterval()</code> con la función de callback y un retraso de <code>200</code> milisegundos. Guárdalo en la variable <code>intervalID</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>setInterval</code> seguido de <code>ourCallback</code> y finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
