ue=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLoad = loadBossLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(startLoad);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>levelData</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y luego <code>boss</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>enemies</code>, <code>reject</code>.</p></body></html>"
